     ///
     /// Clears a bit at a given index in the bitmap.
     ///
     /// # Parameters
     ///
     /// - `index`: Index of the bit to clear.
     ///
     /// # Returns
     ///
     /// Upon success, `Ok(())` is returned. Upon failure, an error is returned instead.
     ///
